ary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Problem**\r\n\r\n#1452 changed the implementation of `ToNodeIterator` for `HtmlIterable` to use the helper function `yew::utils::into_node_iter`.\r\nThis cleaned up the code a lot, but it has the unfortunate consequence that it always returns `Iterator<Item=VNode>` now.\r\nThis violates an invariant imposed by the `ToNodeIterator` trait: \r\n> Generate a token stream which produces a value that implements IntoIterator<Item=T> where T is inferred by the compiler.\r\n\r\n`T` is no longer inferred by the compiler but instead explicitly set to `Html`.\r\nThe consequence of this is that it can no longer be used with `html_nested!`.\r\n\r\n**Steps To Reproduce**\r\nSee #1524\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nThe macro should allow `Into<T>` for any `T`, not just `T = Html`.\r\n\r\nThe previous implementation looked like this (minus macro verbosity):\r\n```rust\r\n(#expr).into_iter().map(|n| n.into())\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe key difference is that `n.into()` isn't explicitly typed and so it can convert into any type that implements `From<N>`, not just `Html`.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Environment:**\r\n - Yew version: 0.17.3","closed_by":{"login":"siku2","id":16530283,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTMwMjgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16530283?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/siku2","html_url":"https://github.com/siku2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siku2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siku2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siku2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siku2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siku2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siku2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siku2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siku2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siku2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/issues/1527/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/issues/1527/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}